    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Daniel pulls a sheet of folded parchment from his coat and hands it to me. It’s what I signed with the Agency, only it i",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1496
        },
        {
          "text": "On instinct, I try to tear up the contract. Nothing happens",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1737
        }
      ],
      "words": 61
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Humans cannot destroy the documents that govern our work,” he says softly. “It was a fail-safe implemented long ago.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1862
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cats can’t do it, either. Even if they could, it wouldn’t help. This is just a copy.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2072
        },
        {
          "text": "His expression shutters. “But I think they also may be doing it to punish me.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2728
        }
      ],
      "words": 53
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“The Lower Levels, as we call them, have a secretarial pool. After I collect your soul, I will be relieved of my Reaper ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3696
        },
        {
          "text": "He closes his eyes, shuddering. “By all accounts, Lucifer is hell to work for.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3851
        },
        {
          "text": "He probably intended that to be a pun to lighten the mood, but it doesn’t work",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3929
        }
      ],
      "words": 60
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“No,” he says, shaking his head. “They are death, Lucy. They can do whatever they like.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4237
        },
        {
